# Copy to .env (git-ignored) only if you want to override defaults.
# NEVER put real secrets, passwords or API keys here: HVWA is deliberately
# vulnerable and its labs are designed to leak configuration.

# Optional HMAC key for challenge flags (at least 16 characters). Leave blank to
# use a random secret generated on first start and kept in the data volume.
# Changing it invalidates flags issued with the previous value.
FLAG_SECRET=
